# Biotech Specialist's trigger for sacrificing an artifact (Black Lotus, a card rather than a token) is already on the
# stack when Bot2 kills the creature with Lightning Bolt (1/3, 3 damage). The ability still resolves: the damage is dealt by
# the creature as it last existed (CR 608.2h, 113.7a), so Bot2 loses 2 life, 20 - 2 - 0 = 18, the Bolt having gone at the
# creature.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Biotech Specialist
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Biotech Specialist.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Biotech Specialist)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Graveyard = Biotech Specialist; Black Lotus
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
